<title>UK: UK meals/feeds quiet ahead of trade dinner.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds quiet ahead of trade dinner.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business on the UK meals and feeds market was at a virtual standstill on Wednesday afternoon with many players absent ahead of the trade dinner in Bristol.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal offers were around three stg up following the higher close in Chicago on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Traders reported only one trade when 217 stg a tonne was paid for high protein soymeal ex-store east coast.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
